{"4512890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forbidden Sight", "steam_appid": 4512890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forbidden Sight</i> is a <strong>multiplayer, action-adventure</strong> stealth game where you play as a gang of art thieves. Trapped inside a wax museum after a heist gone wrong, you must manipulate <strong>electromagnetic light </strong>to reveal the unseen… and <strong>survive </strong>what it awakens. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun with electromagnetic waves </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wax museum setting with periods of human history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and exploration</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friends invited you to steal the most valuable artifact from the infamous Human Archive Museum (H.A.M) with them! As an experienced art thief, the mission is clear: you must collect valuable technologies, sneak around the museum's security system, and of course, grab the largest artifact of them all: the legendary Wax Figurine.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forbidden Sight</i> is a <strong>multiplayer, action-adventure</strong> stealth game where you play as a gang of art thieves. Trapped inside a wax museum after a heist gone wrong, you must manipulate <strong>electromagnetic light </strong>to reveal the unseen… and <strong>survive </strong>what it awakens. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun with electromagnetic waves </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wax museum setting with periods of human history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and exploration</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friends invited you to steal the most valuable artifact from the infamous Human Archive Museum (H.A.M) with them! As an experienced art thief, the mission is clear: you must collect valuable technologies, sneak around the museum's security system, and of course, grab the largest artifact of them all: the legendary Wax Figurine.</p>", "short_description": "FORBIDDEN SIGHT is a 4-player online co-op survival and stealth horror. Survive the Human Archive Museum (H.A.M)'s security system as you steal artifacts from different eras of human history, using electromagnetic waves to navigate through your heist.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512890/b555d0dbc69bfb3eae660637fa6aecd01afffabf/header.jpg?t=1778172514", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512890/e7c129cb426a18dc53900ebca2dc94a044885d7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778172514", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512890/e7c129cb426a18dc53900ebca2dc94a044885d7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778172514", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  AMD Ryzen 5 3600 / Intel Core i7 8700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> MD Radeon RX 5700 / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  AMD Ryzen 5 3600 / Intel Core i7 8700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> MD Radeon RX 5700 / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>"}, "mac_r